{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bf8606d5e1ef90067ee7958cef84043f8ab8fb36342d82706e13659f60d6413d", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの発足に合わせて、\n亜美の宣材写真もリニューアルすることになった）", "zh": "（为了配合39PROJECT的开始，\n亚美的宣传照也要重新拍过。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7f394c30ec3e5db0a0c6552a283ea2a5120f292e9a0943a9d13a25057ba53021", "ja": "（ただ、亜美本人は今日がなんの仕事なのか、\nよくわかってないような……）", "zh": "（只是，亚美本人似乎还不太了解\n今天的工作内容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "95879eba98d625a7669ae9909742106829a1d91463bac655af209ae027bbd5b4", "ja": "兄ちゃん、センザイ写真ってなんだっけ？\nオドロキの白さ☆　みたいな感じ？", "zh": "大哥哥，选船照是什么来着？\n是选艘好船出海去☆这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ce64d379450bd2deb98870a63d58df428298e5470d8b9433589435cfce8510b8", "ja": "その洗剤じゃなくて、宣伝材料の写真だ。\n前にもたくさん撮っただろ？", "zh": "不是选船，是宣传照。\n之前也拍过很多了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "fd6027113159fe47fd65c086cd86633f8fcda534ae3a43f3e83b26333f9bf975", "ja": "あ、そっか。……やだな～、今のは軽いジャブだよ、\n兄ちゃん。ジャブジャブ！　手揉み洗い！", "zh": "啊，是喔……讨厌啦～刚才是在试探你啦，\n大哥哥。试探试探！五探六探！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1005_camman", "source_sha256": "1e9194be4d88100d7a4c44c9ac6ea0db389cb7043ab66bf5d79d9dca2d51c0db", "ja": "ふふっ。\n亜美ちゃん、面白いですね！", "zh": "呵呵。\n亚美，你很有趣呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "1be92e7ae7f11fbf7ea656a706a8f083bdf41f4303ab17ffe5f17165c47e46a6", "ja": "ホント！？　亜美スゴい？\nトップお笑い芸人になれそう？", "zh": "真的吗！？亚美厉害吗？\n能成为顶尖搞笑艺人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "57984b7d846bc49820e17d91c03eadce711d14dec5b2f6f67c8748e1c204708f", "ja": "なれるかもしれないが、\nまずはアイドルでトップを目指そうな！", "zh": "或许可以啦，\n但你还是先以顶尖偶像为目标吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "35912debbe6bc43b4c586001c1600ef90aa94eed18a497d963c73c11131c38c1", "ja": "は～い♪", "zh": "好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d1cf68e65f9ce51c91f5426a95e603a70cec6ab19dca9d7a4c5802e72fd79375", "ja": "ふう、やれやれ……。さて、撮影が始まるぞ。\n今回はどんな写真にしてもらおうか？", "zh": "呼，真是的……好啦，要开始拍照啰。\n这次想拍出怎么样的照片？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "0c3661895f57ec1e19327d7a66d3bba0aded4d798f235c5db29944e2876a1c4d", "ja": "んとねー。前に撮ったのは、なんかよくわかんなくて、\nすっごいフツーっぽくなっちゃったから～。", "zh": "那个啊～之前拍照时亚美还不是很懂，\n所以拍得很普通～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "130f06a6de7e06bde2ba1beb51e8acc63d8eacef271366947fd76b25cac5df02", "ja": "亜美、今度はもっと亜美っぽいのがいいな！", "zh": "亚美这次想拍成更符合亚美的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2a44738a895733c6646ab9205ed9d009a0f03cb940d5b13f23923454c7e26938", "ja": "亜美っぽいか……たとえば？", "zh": "符合亚美的风格吗……例如说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "b4bdef1cdc97ba98600d86b1a327a5c4d8a702e8bcb49c1df12af9cc4674f1d0", "ja": "たとえば？　……こう、仲間達を逃がすために、\n落ちてくる天井を必死に支えてる亜美とか！", "zh": "例如说……像是为了让伙伴们逃走，\n亚美拚命撑住天花板的样子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "fbf2061f56e10f2456f7832249cb51c33c4d6a9c47b3a56fb7656b4756767f75", "ja": "みんな、早く先に行って！　亜美、絶対みんなに\n追いつくから……！！　振りかえ……らないで～……！", "zh": "大家快走吧！亚美绝对会追上大家的……！！\n不要……回头～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1015_camman", "source_sha256": "56be4a7bc936269f0b7f523ae58a7c695586085a11133f81d30edbfd96c59bc4", "ja": "ぷっ……クスクス。", "zh": "噗……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8ded02f4a4dd9b511955a833ed3df0c73088a75f8d63e4e1c23ec0ed3b175b2c", "ja": "って、カメラマンさんにウケてもダメだぞ亜美。\nほら、テイク2！", "zh": "就算摄影师觉得很好笑也是没用的喔，亚美。\n好啦，Take 2！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "486da6102080493060dc084b3982c7299bf23acf3d3abdfbd65b3d20b544fbf7", "ja": "（こんな調子で、撮影は終始爆笑の中終わった。\n雰囲気も良かったし、大成功……かな？）", "zh": "（就这样，拍摄在不断爆笑中结束了。\n气氛也很好，算是大成功……吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "04b79fec9e298808bc6883aafe38e976d47b84af6d93ba41072d4b81018a3689", "ja": "兄ちゃん、ただいまー！　亜美、\nウルトラキュート＆せくしーに激写されてきたよ～。", "zh": "大哥哥，亚美回来了──！\n亚美被拍得超可爱又超有魅力喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b46c10b44fd737fde577327b64607cd6c60751eaf48ec84280fbae860fe7b195", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま。\n元気いっぱいで、亜美らしい写真になったな。", "zh": "嗯，辛苦你了。\n充满活力，是很有亚美风格的照片呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "490a151bbe1e5ec8b50e46b9d2e75a2e43a6b9ec3933a431e5d85b22fe1c5607", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　亜美も今回ばかりは、うっかり\n隠してた力を1000％近くお見せしましたからねぇ。", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪因为亚美这次不小心让你\n看到将近1000%的隐藏实力了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1021_p", "source_sha256": "301a901882171bf56e6362bc770c93115b3c1b503e451f89b04940880af0793f", "ja": "なんだ、そんなに隠してたのか？\nそれじゃ今度から、もっと頑張ってもらわないとな。", "zh": "什么嘛，你隐藏了那么多吗？\n那从下次开始，就要请你更努力才行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "aa972f787fc1bf1685f7bec9403b04bd8a9f05996c1bbfafe7ae017854b362b5", "ja": "うあうあ、今のなし！\n頑張って100％出しただけ～！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊，刚刚说的不算！\n亚美只是很努力地使出了100%的实力～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "84d2884c5a45ef76777b5284cf44ee45aca68ab86388e9b5f101ec665940ba96", "ja": "でも、これまで亜美の攻撃を耐え続けた兄ちゃんも、\n今回ばかりはメロメロンだったっしょ？", "zh": "话说一直以来撑过亚美攻击的大哥哥，\n这次也被亚美迷得神魂颠倒了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1024_p", "source_sha256": "57c73e33186adbc0e2f69bd16c9dd112556f8d9d74be6f9e262d1373c835c77d", "ja": "ああ。でも、亜美がそんなに頑張ってくれるとはな……\n何か特別なことでもあったのか？", "zh": "嗯。不过，没想到亚美愿意这么努力……\n有什么特别的原因吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1025_011ami", "source_sha256": "4b1030c1d06a3c638dd99dc86614cf7f41300d5468789cc295b99181f1b04b8e", "ja": "何言ってんの、兄ちゃん！\n特別も特別、メチャスゴのスペシャルだよー！", "zh": "你在说什么啊，大哥哥！\n特别啊，很特别，是超级Special喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "00f98902237c42126a1661757bad8471b83b1897aabff58f38b53ee0043cfbb3", "ja": "だって亜美達に、コーハイがいっぱいできるんでしょ？\n39人プロジェクトなんでしょ？", "zh": "因为亚美我们，会有很多新后辈对吧？\n是39人PROJECT对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "6b7ebae9ab5710d7cdbe431e62df5598585ae999857b64084a0eec2ff249665c", "ja": "39人も新しい友達ができるんだもん、\nそりゃテンションも上るってもんですぜ、ダンナ！", "zh": "毕竟会交到39个新朋友，\n当然会兴奋呀，客官！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "87995147d076b5d816550baf269a35196a2edd510cf5b4af4e1dcd89c39eae26", "ja": "そうか、39プロジェクトか……なるほどな！\n亜美も楽しみなんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，因为39PROJECT吗……原来如此！\n亚美也很期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1029_011ami", "source_sha256": "182c615790bddbef26f87815b92ef6e145b6913193a820417171eed668bcab06", "ja": "うん！　亜美、早くみんなと遊びたいんだ～。\nこれからいっぱい、計画立てなくちゃ！", "zh": "嗯！亚美好想赶快跟大家玩～\n接下来得做很多计划才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "65a596c27a35fd81ac16c5d559dcf3cd406b6e145ae931b500df95022b6f6b3c", "ja": "モチロン、ちゃんと兄ちゃんも入れたげるから。\n楽しみにしててね、兄ちゃん☆", "zh": "当然，也会让大哥哥一起玩的。\n好好期待喔，大哥哥☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_011ami_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_011ami_002_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d0a7db0ebf481cf7fe95c24ba7122cc91c047164e92382266ebc619d11cd5cd7", "ja": "（写真には、希望に溢れた最高の笑顔が写っている。\n亜美のこの笑顔に、後輩達も勇気づけられるはずだ！）", "zh": "（照片上，拍到了满怀希望的绝佳笑容。\n亚美的笑容应该也能带给后辈们勇气吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
